VoCo / Large-Scale-Medical
--------------------------
Project: https://github.com/Luffy03/Large-Scale-Medical
License: Apache License 2.0
Models:  https://huggingface.co/Luffy503/VoCo/tree/main

The VoCo/SwinV2 encoder configuration handled in models/swin_voco_utils.py follows the upstream VoCo pretraining setup. Pretrained weights are not distributed with this repository; download VoCo_B_SSL_head.pt from the model hub above under its own terms.

